<asp:Content ID="BodyContent" ContentPlaceHolderID="MainContent" runat="server">
    <div style="max-width:900px;margin:28px auto;padding:22px;background:#fff;border-radius:6px;box-shadow:0 6px 18px rgba(0,0,0,.06);font-family:'Segoe UI', Roboto, Arial, sans-serif;">
        <h1 style="margin-top:0;">Privacy Policy</h1>
        <p style="color:#555">Last updated: November 14, 2025</p>

        <section>
            <h2>Introduction</h2>
            <p>Royal City Temporary Agency ("we", "our", or "us") is committed to protecting the privacy of visitors to this website. This Privacy Policy explains what information we collect, how we use it, and your choices.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
            <h3>Personal information</h3>
            <p>When you contact us, apply for jobs, or otherwise interact with the site, we may collect personal information such as your name, email address, phone number, resume, and other information you choose to provide.</p>

            <h3>Non-personal information</h3>
            <p>We may automatically collect non-personal information such as browser type, device information, IP address, pages visited, and usage metrics to help improve the site.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
            <ul>
                <li>To respond to inquiries and provide services (recruiting, placements, support).</li>
                <li>To process job applications, resumes, and background checks when applicable.</li>
                <li>To improve and maintain our website and analytics.</li>
                <li>To comply with legal obligations.</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Cookies and Tracking</h2>
            <p>We may use cookies and similar technologies for session management, analytics, and preferences. You can disable cookies via your browser settings, though some features may not work correctly if cookies are disabled.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Third-Party Services</h2>
            <p>We may use trusted third-party services (for analytics, hosting, email delivery, etc.). Those services have their own privacy practices — links or embedded content may transfer data to those providers.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Data Security</h2>
            <p>We use administrative, technical, and physical measures to help protect your information. However, no method of transmission or storage is 100% secure; we cannot guarantee absolute security.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Your Choices</h2>
            <p>You can opt out of marketing communications by following the unsubscribe link in emails or contacting us. You may request access, correction, or deletion of personal information by contacting us at the address below.</p>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>Contact Us</h2>
            <p>If you have questions about this Privacy Policy or requests concerning your personal data, contact:</p>
            <p>Email: <a href="mailto:privacy@royalcitytemps.com">privacy@royalcitytemps.com</a><br/>Address: Royal City Temporary Agency</p>
        </section>

        <p style="font-size:13px;color:#666;margin-top:18px;">This document is provided for informational purposes and does not constitute legal advice. If you need a policy tailored to specific legal requirements (GDPR, CCPA, etc.), consult legal counsel.</p>
